    "artifact.sephiria.charm_of_strength.flavor":  "上面写着“力量”二字，却怎么看都不太靠谱。",
    "artifact.sephiria.shield_textbook.flavor":  "写着“不要给幼小动物看”。",
    "artifact.sephiria.sword_textbook.flavor":  "写着“不要给幼小动物看”。",
    "artifact.sephiria.wind_score.flavor":  "上面记着一段听不见的旋律。",
    "artifact.sephiria.affix.special_attack":  "- 特殊攻击伤害 +%s%%",
    "artifact.sephiria.affix.melee_range":  "- 近战攻击范围 +%s%%",
    "artifact.sephiria.affix.dash_regen":  "- 冲刺恢复速度 +%s%%",
    "artifact.sephiria.affix.dash_charges":  "- 冲刺次数 +%s",
    "artifact.sephiria.affix.highest_element":  "- 最高元素伤害 +%s",
    "artifact.sephiria.deft_amulet.flavor":  "挂着它的人总能在最后一刻偏过头去。",
    "artifact.sephiria.pinwheel.flavor":  "念咒语的时候，即使没有风也开始旋转。",
    "artifact.sephiria.specimen_beak.flavor":  "胆小的鸟用来炫耀的东西。",
    "artifact.sephiria.evergreen_cloak.flavor":  "披上它就像钻进了树影里，风都找不到你。",
    "artifact.sephiria.resistance_band.flavor":  "拉开它需要力气，收回来的时候力气会还给你。",
    "artifact.sephiria.warm_stone.flavor":  "揣在怀里久了，连拳头都热得发烫。",
    "artifact.sephiria.slate_of_rally.flavor":  "人一多，劲就往一处使。",
    "artifact.sephiria.slate_of_wave.flavor":  "一浪推一浪，退下去的那一下也带着力。",
    "artifact.sephiria.slate_of_double_star.flavor":  "天上两颗星，一上一下，互相看着。",
    "artifact.sephiria.slate_of_handshake.flavor":  "握过的手，两头都算数。",
    "artifact.sephiria.colorless_cube.flavor":  "一块没有颜色的立方体，盯着它看久了，会觉得自己也变透明了。",
    "artifact.sephiria.silver_plate.flavor":  "摆盘用的银盘，边缘被磨得发亮——上面盛过什么，没人说得清。",
    "artifact.sephiria.encouragement_banner.flavor":  "插在哪里，哪里就是阵地。旗子一立，谁都不好意思偷懒。",
    "artifact.sephiria.haste_grimoire.flavor":  "书页翻得比风还快，字迹只有加速的你能看清。",
    "artifact.sephiria.red_dew.flavor":  "叶尖上凝着一滴红露，像血，也像酒。",
    "artifact.sephiria.longing_amulet.flavor":  "「还想再打一下」——这股念头会替你瞄准要害。",
    "artifact.sephiria.fault_probe.flavor":  "探针抖个不停，指向的正是敌人最脆弱的那一处。",
    "artifact.sephiria.crittons_seal.flavor":  "盖在商店契约上的红印——印落之处，价钱都得听他的。",
    "artifact.sephiria.lucky_medal.flavor":  "寻找地上落叶的幸运象征。",
    "artifact.sephiria.golden_maple_leaf.flavor":  "一片不肯褪色的秋叶，经验都沉淀在叶脉里。",
    "artifact.sephiria.sword_earring.flavor":  "剑与盾凑成一对耳环。",
    "artifact.sephiria.keen_eye.flavor":  "记载着锐利之眼魔法的书。",
    "artifact.sephiria.magic_carrot.flavor":  "偶尔发现的特别胡萝卜。不会腐烂但不能吃。",
    "artifact.sephiria.sharp_flint.flavor":  "村子里不怎么用的东西。",
    "artifact.sephiria.resonance_stone.flavor":  "与最强大的属性之力共鸣，发出清澈的声响。",
    "artifact.sephiria.lightning_struck_branch.flavor":  "有一种沉重而独特的气味。",
    "artifact.sephiria.electric_bug.flavor":  "会自发产生电力的虫子，可以驯养。",
    "artifact.sephiria.qilin_horn.flavor":  "为了防止伤害其他动物，它被皮革包裹着。",
    "artifact.sephiria.electric_amulet.flavor":  "平息持有者的爆发性怒火。",
    "artifact.sephiria.sande_earrings.flavor":  "使用图书馆开发的新材料，重量轻。",
    "artifact.sephiria.thunder_verdict.flavor":  "记载着雷之裁决魔法的书。",
    "artifact.sephiria.storm_compass.flavor":  "为了追逐雷云而制造的工程工具。",
    "artifact.sephiria.firefly.flavor":  "发出冷光的昆虫。触摸时会有刺痛感。",
    "artifact.sephiria.typhoon_score.flavor":  "感受吧，那瞬间驻留的光。",
    "artifact.sephiria.stone_flower.flavor":  "花朵存在于天上、地上、地下。",
    "artifact.sephiria.sapote_fruit.flavor":  "口渴时嚼一嚼不知为何就舒服多了。",
    "artifact.sephiria.lightning_rod.flavor":  "它外形像剑，但由易碎的材料制成。",
    "artifact.sephiria.pointy_acorn.flavor":  "掌控闪电的族群喜欢的果实。",
    "artifact.sephiria.thunder_stone.flavor":  "发现金属碰撞会落雷，但因为危险没人使用。",
    "artifact.sephiria.cloudseed_arrow.flavor":  "据说朝云射击会下雨。",
    "artifact.sephiria.mast_model.flavor":  "过去发生大洪水时，有人试图绑船以求生存。",
    "artifact.sephiria.raven_tablet.flavor":  "容纳万物的连续性。",
    "artifact.sephiria.solis_fracto.flavor":  "为讨好精灵而低效制作的匕首状徽章。",
    "artifact.sephiria.solis_parvo.flavor":  "授予与精灵同等者的匕首形徽章。",
    "artifact.sephiria.red_snake_eye.flavor":  "含有炽热气息的宝石。即使在黑暗中也能指引方向。",
    "artifact.sephiria.ambergris.flavor":  "龙的唾液凝结而成的块状物",
